start":194,"end":196,"surface":"智伯","kind":"person","person_id":"pio_cvf_9l8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m009-0200","start":200,"end":202,"surface":"左右","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未名氏稱或尚待核定的嵌套親屬指代，不補姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m009-0206","start":206,"end":208,"surface":"襄子","kind":"person","person_id":"w0u_fhy_mih","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m009-0223","start":223,"end":225,"surface":"智伯","kind":"person","person_id":"pio_cvf_9l8","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-086-cike","book_id":"b-shiji-086","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-086-cike"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:p011","text":"既去，頃之，襄子當出，豫讓伏於所當過之橋下。襄子至橋，馬驚，襄子曰：「此必是豫讓也。」使人問之，果豫讓也。於是襄子乃數豫讓曰：「子不嘗事范、中行氏乎？智伯盡滅之，而子不爲報讎，而反委質臣於智伯。智伯亦已死矣，而子獨何以爲之報讎之深也？」豫讓曰：「臣事范、中行氏，范、中行氏皆衆人遇我，我故衆人報之。至於智伯，國士遇我，我故國士報之。」襄子喟然嘆息而泣曰：「嗟乎豫子！子之爲智伯，名既成矣，而寡人赦子，亦已足矣。子其自爲計，寡人不復釋子！」使兵圍之。豫讓曰：「臣聞明主不掩人之美，而忠臣有死名之義。前君已寬赦臣，天下莫不稱君之賢。今日之事，臣固伏誅，然願請君之衣而撃之焉，以致報讎之意，則雖死不恨。非所敢望也，敢布腹心！」於是襄子大義之，乃使使持衣與豫讓。豫讓拔劍三躍而撃之，曰：「吾可以下報智伯矣！」遂伏劍自殺。死之日，趙國志士聞之，皆爲涕泣。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m011-0006","start":6,"end":8,"surface":"襄子","kind":"person","person_id":"w0u_fhy_mih","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m011-0011","start":11,"end":13,"surface":"豫讓","kind":"person","person_id":"op3_d14_c7u","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m011-0022","start":22,"end":24,"surface":"襄子","kind":"person","person_id":"w0u_fhy_mih","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m011-0030","start":30,"end":32,"surface":"襄子","kind":"person","person_id":"w0u_fhy_mih","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m011-0038","start":38,"end":40,"surface":"豫讓","kind":"person","person_id":"op3_d14_c7u","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m011-0043","start":43,"end":45,"surface":"使人","kind"